              – the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+orthogonal+Lie+algebra"} special orthogonal Lie algebra
              – is a morphism in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Smooth%E2%88%9EGrpd"} Smooth∞Grpd
              of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mfrac
                      %mn 1
                      %mn 2
                    %msub
                      %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                        %mi p
                      %mn 1
                    %mo :
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mi Spin
                    %mo →
                    %msup
                      %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                        %mi B
