              over the trivial differential cocycle.
            %p
              More generally (see
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+cohomology"} twisted cohomology
              %strong twisted differential string structures
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-pullback"} (∞,1)-pullback
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
