                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quasi-isomorphism"} quasi-isomorphism
          %p
            The point of introducing the resolution
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
