          %p Clearly, if we take into account also gauge transformations of the gauge bundle, we should replace this by the full
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mrow
                    %mtable
